              '\r\n'
              '  /// Compute individual AVS monthly rente.\r\n'
              '  ///\r\n'
              '  /// Takes into account:\r\n'
              '  /// - Contribution duration (lacunes, arrivalAge) — LAVS art. 29\r\n'
