              '\r\n'
              '  /// AVS rente based on RAMD using Echelle 44 (LAVS art. 34).\r\n'
              '  ///\r\n'
              '  /// Concave lookup + linear interpolation between table points.\r\n'
              '  /// Source: Memento 6.01 — Tables des rentes AVS/AI (OFAS 2025).\r\n'
              '  /// RAMD <= 0 → 0 (no salary data).\r\n'
              '  /// RAMD <= 14\'700 → 1\'260/mois (minimum).\r\n'
